 "content": "[{\"id\":\"onboarding-header\",\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\"h6 text-muted uppercase\\\">Quick Start</span>\",\"col\":12}},{\"id\":\"onboarding-body\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Configure an Attendance Penalty Policy</b> \u2014 choose <i>Factor</i>, <i>Fixed Per Hour</i>, or <i>Penalty Matrix</i>. See <i>Configuration</i> below.<b>Open Discipline HR Settings</b> \u2014 pick the default policy and salary calculation basis (month days, salary basis).<b>Optional:</b> create an <b>Attendance Pre-Authorization</b> ahead of time to excuse a known late entry or early exit.<b>Submit an Attendance</b> with late or early minutes \u2014 the system consumes any matching pre-auth, otherwise records the event in the Grace Ledger and creates a Discipline Penalty when grace is exhausted.\",\"col\":12}},{\"id\":\"page-header\",\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\"h4\\\"><b>Discipline HR</b></span>\",\"col\":12}},{\"id\":\"dashboard-header\",\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<span class=\\\"h6 text-muted uppercase\\\">Dashboard</span>\",\"col\":12}},{\"id\":\"nc-pending-penalty\",\"type\":\"number_card\",\"data\":{\"number_card_name\":\"Pending Discipline Penalty\",\"col\":4}},{\"id\":\"nc-penalties-this-month\",\"type\":\"number_card\",\"data\":{\"number_card_name\":\"Penalties This Month\",\"col\":4}},{\"id\":\"chart-permissions-status\",\"type\":\"chart\",\"data\":{\"chart_name\":\"Attendance Pre-Authorization Status\",\"col\":6}},{\"id\":\"chart-penalty-status\",\"type\":\"chart\",\"data\":{\"chart_name\":\"Discipline Penalty Status\",\"col\":6}},{\"id\":\"spacer-1\",\"type\":\"spacer\",\"data\":{\"col\":12}},{\"id\":\"quick-access-header\",\"type\":\"header\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<br>\",\"col\":12}},{\"id\":\"card-transactions\",\"type\":\"card\",\"data\":{\"card_name\":\"Transactions\",\"col\":4}},{\"id\":\"card-configuration\",\"type\":\"card\",\"data\":{\"card_name\":\"Configuration\",\"col